    "fromLine": 26,
    "toLine": 26,
    "text": "回放时用保存的数据静态重放，且不会向服务端确认。",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R05-047",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/27-跟庄重扔骰子.md",
    "section": "27-跟庄重扔骰子 五、重连回放 第1条",
    "fromLine": 30,
    "toLine": 30,
    "text": "只补数据时仅保存数据，不播放骰子与跟庄动画、不播放飘分。",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R05-048",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/28-升庄广播.md",
    "section": "28-升庄广播 什么时候出现 第1条",
    "fromLine": 3,
    "toLine": 3,
    "text": "本局升庄成功时，服务端广播新的庄家等级。",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R05-049",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/28-升庄广播.md",
    "section": "28-升庄广播 一、数据记录 第1条",
    "fromLine": 7,
    "toLine": 7,
    "text": "更新庄家等级与连庄数，用于庄家标记和结算显示。",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R05-050",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/28-升庄广播.md",
    "section": "28-升庄广播 二、界面变化 第1行",
    "fromLine": 13,
    "toLine": 13,
    "text": "萧山好友房：若此时正在等开局骰子，则等骰子播完再播“升庄”。",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R05-051",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/28-升庄广播.md",
    "section": "28-升庄广播 二、界面变化 第1行",
    "fromLine": 13,
    "toLine": 13,
    "text": "萧山好友房：不在等开局骰子时，立即播放“升庄”。",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R05-052",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/28-升庄广播.md",
    "section": "28-升庄广播 二、界面变化 第1行",
    "fromLine": 13,
    "toLine": 13,
    "text": "萧山好友房：升级失败或简单模式下直接跳过升庄表现。",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R05-053",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/28-升庄广播.md",
    "section": "28-升庄广播 二、界面变化 第2行",
    "fromLine": 14,
    "toLine": 14,
    "text": "其他玩法：先隐藏全桌庄家标记。",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R05-054",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/28-升庄广播.md",
    "section": "28-升庄广播 二、界面变化 第2行",
    "fromLine": 14,
    "toLine": 14,
    "text": "其他玩法：再在协议座位显示“庄”。",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R05-055",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/28-升庄广播.md",
    "section": "28-升庄广播 二、界面变化 第2行",
    "fromLine": 14,
    "toLine": 14,
    "text": "其他玩法：更新连庄档位，超过 3 档按 3 档显示。",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R05-056",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/28-升庄广播.md",
    "section": "28-升庄广播 二、界面变化 第3行",
    "fromLine": 15,
    "toLine": 15,
    "text": "其他玩法：在协议座位位置播放“加庄”动画。",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R05-057",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/28-升庄广播.md",
    "section": "28-升庄广播 二、界面变化 第3行",
    "fromLine": 15,
    "toLine": 15,
    "text": "其他玩法：升级失败、简单模式或没有对应节点时直接跳过加庄动画。",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R05-058",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/28-升庄广播.md",
    "section": "28-升庄广播 三、连带影响 第1条",
    "fromLine": 19,
    "toLine": 19,
    "text": "萧山好友房要求“先开局骰子、后升庄”，由开局阶段记录的状态排队控制。",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R05-059",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/28-升庄广播.md",
    "section": "28-升庄广播 三、连带影响 第2条",
    "fromLine": 20,
    "toLine": 20,
    "text": "回放时加庄并入最近的“掷骰子”步骤一起播放，保证骰子与加庄动画都不丢。",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R05-060",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/28-升庄广播.md",
    "section": "28-升庄广播 四、重连回放 第1条",
    "fromLine": 24,
    "toLine": 24,
    "text": "只补数据时只更新庄家等级与连庄数，不显示庄家标记、不播放动画。",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R05-061",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/29-匹配场底分.md",
    "section": "29-匹配场底分 什么时候出现 第1条",
    "fromLine": 3,
    "toLine": 3,
    "text": "匹配场下发底分时触发匹配场底分处理。",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R05-062",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/29-匹配场底分.md",
    "section": "29-匹配场底分 一、前置条件 第1条",
    "fromLine": 7,
    "toLine": 7,
    "text": "只有匹配场才处理底分消息。",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R05-063",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/29-匹配场底分.md",
    "section": "29-匹配场底分 一、前置条件 第2条",
    "fromLine": 8,
    "toLine": 8,
    "text": "底分小于等于 0 时不做处理。",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R05-064",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/29-匹配场底分.md",
    "section": "29-匹配场底分 二、数据记录 第1条",
    "fromLine": 12,
    "toLine": 12,
    "text": "保存底分数据。",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R05-065",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/29-匹配场底分.md",
    "section": "29-匹配场底分 二、数据记录 第2条",
    "fromLine": 12,
    "toLine": 12,
    "text": "服务端可能用两种数字格式，需统一转成普通数字。",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R05-066",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/29-匹配场底分.md",
    "section": "29-匹配场底分 三、界面变化 第1行",
    "fromLine": 18,
    "toLine": 18,
    "text": "背景底分文字显示“底分：XX”。",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R05-067",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/29-匹配场底分.md",
    "section": "29-匹配场底分 三、界面变化 第2行",
    "fromLine": 19,
    "toLine": 19,
    "text": "背景的“游戏中”状态页切到游戏中状态并显示空闲图标。",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R05-068",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/29-匹配场底分.md",
    "section": "29-匹配场底分 三、界面变化 第3行",
    "fromLine": 20,
    "toLine": 20,
    "text": "背景牌桌美术字按当前玩法切换。",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R05-069",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/29-匹配场底分.md",
    "section": "29-匹配场底分 三、界面变化 第4行",
    "fromLine": 21,
    "toLine": 21,
    "text": "未开局时房间名按房间数据显示。",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R05-070",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/29-匹配场底分.md",
    "section": "29-匹配场底分 四、连带影响 第1条",
    "fromLine": 25,
    "toLine": 25,
    "text": "背景底分只在匹配场显示；包厢 / 好友房底分由房间规则展示，不走本消息。",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R05-071",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/29-匹配场底分.md",
    "section": "29-匹配场底分 四、连带影响 第2条",
    "fromLine": 26,
    "toLine": 26,
    "text": "重连时本消息只保存数据，底分文字由后续“游戏开始状态”或“底分刷新”补齐。",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R05-072",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/29-匹配场底分.md",
    "section": "29-匹配场底分 五、重连回放 第1条",
    "fromLine": 30,
    "toLine": 30,
    "text": "只补数据时不刷新底分文字。",
    "mandatory": true
  }
]
